      {
        "id": "textbook-bsc-example",
        "moduleId": "discrete-capacity",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "例9-10：二元对称信道的容量",
        "markdown": "信源由符号“0”“1”组成，符号传输速率 $r=1000$ symbol/s，两符号等概、各为 $1/2$；信道为对称信道，符号错误率为 $1/128$。\n\n转移概率矩阵为\n\n| 发送\\接收 | $y_1=0$ | $y_2=1$ |\n|---|---|---|\n| $x_1=0$ | $127/128$ | $1/128$ |\n| $x_2=1$ | $1/128$ | $127/128$ |\n\n由贝叶斯公式（等概输入时后验与转移概率同形）可得 $p(x_1\\mid y_1)=127/128$、$p(x_1\\mid y_2)=1/128$、$p(x_2\\mid y_1)=1/128$、$p(x_2\\mid y_2)=127/128$；联合概率对角元为 $0.49609375$，非对角元为 $0.00390625$，且 $p(y_1)=p(y_2)=0.5$。\n\n信源的平均自信息量（熵）为\n\n$$\nH(x)=-\\left[\\frac{1}{2}\\log_2\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\log_2\\frac{1}{2}\\right]=1\\ \\text{bit/symbol}\n$$\n\n条件信息熵 $H(x\\mid y)=0.045$，于是\n\n$$\nC=\\max_{p(x)}\\left[H(x)-H(x\\mid y)\\right]=0.955\\ \\text{bit/symbol}\n$$\n\n$$\nC_t=1000\\times 0.955=955\\ \\text{bit/s}\n$$",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
